# Civil War Strategy: the game starts with music and sound on, as the Rebels. Nothing is heard
# (script_mute, port/script.bm), but the tunes run and take their time: "Shenandoah" at the
# title, then, in the saved game of events-south, the tune of an event that favors the South (a
# loan from Europe, by forced dice). The notes are not checked.
#! seed 1863
#! cfg side=2 noise=2 bold=0
#! data events-south
#! dice 0,.05,.5,.9,.9,.1
#! timeout 600

rule 1 key space
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key enter

# The title menu, after "Shenandoah": Resume Saved Game; the Load menu: the one save.
play until 2:V
digest
text r
play until 2:L
key enter

# November 1863: END TURN.
play until 2:M
digest
text e

# January 1864. Files, Quit to DOS, Yes, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
